      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know i should talk to someone but it feels pointless. like... what's the point of talking about it when everything is just gone? i look at his side of the bed and it's just empty. it's like the part of me that actually lived died with him. i just feel so tired of pretending that there's anything left for me here.",
